 own pieces.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user states that watching a music documentary felt like something was missing and didn't engage them in the way they had hoped.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_848dcb0e5c55f34d70033595\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1\", \"id\": \"e38\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_3cdb7daafe8335b16a5639d1\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [40, 41], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_a0c1e399a5a548b49b046cb8\", \"prem_60eca48f797101e48ab30125\"], \"source_alias\": \"s35\", \"id\": \"src_848dcb0e5c55f34d70033595\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1\", \"start\": 1339, \"end\": 1686, \"exact_quote\": \"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\", \"raw_text_hash\": \"97a13cbc5bfeff771ff3594db7911e39465543994e7a3a76cae81fe0c4c4b6fd\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_music_preferences\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"97a13cbc5bfeff771ff3594db7911e39465543994e7a3a76cae81fe0c4c4b6fd\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [40, 41], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_60eca48f797101e48ab30125\", \"prem_a0c1e399a5a548b49b046cb8\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 1339, \"end\": 1686, \"exact_quote\": \"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection