 musical journeys, but the reality was that keeping up with a consistent schedule felt overwhelming. It was a challenge balancing interviews, show notes, and social media promotion, and eventually, my passion began to wane under the pressure of production deadlines. \"}, {\"node_id\": \"user_music_history\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"The user lost interest in music theory because it felt like a chore and took away joy.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"User states they lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy they find in music, and that diving into technical aspects became a chore.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_650c0b93e2b4d6da1f19d37a\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7c973803319b0b032a23a834dfe4d7031c42cbaa315dba7d5243d255867dd55\", \"id\": \"e1\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_2b42d031d01c898d1672197b\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [24], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_8c3c63703fc29b5f6569cc4e\", \"prem_da9f6b6f383815fb60cd82c0\", \"prem_c2d0581beabdd9dbf06711bd\"], \"source_alias\": \"s3\", \"id\": \"src_650c0b93e2b4d6da1f19d37a\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7c973803319b0b032a23a834dfe4d7031c42cbaa315dba7d5243d255867dd55\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 482, \"exact_quote\": \"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \", \"raw_text_hash\": \"1055c3e0421c9754963575308bb90ef0f52c5241bd188fdd3bb876746da69c82\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_music_history\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"1055c3e0421c9754963575308bb90ef0f52c5241bd188fdd3bb876746da69c82\", \"source_role\": \"u